# Doom Reigns Supreme: "Whenever a Villain you control enters, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life. Put a plan
# counter on this enchantment. When the fifth plan counter is put on this enchantment, sacrifice it. When you do, target
# opponent exiles the top five cards of their library. You may cast up to two spells from among the exiled cards without
# paying their mana costs." Bot1's Villains enter five times: Serpent Specialist and Aerial Doombot cast on turn 1, the
# Doombot blinked by Ephemerate on turn 3 and again by its rebound in the turn-5 upkeep, and a second Doombot on turn 5.
# Each drains 1. The fifth plan counter sacrifices it; Bot2 exiles Lightning Bolt, Ornithopter, Ancestral Recall, an Island
# and a Mountain, and Bot1 casts two of them free - the Ornithopter and the Bolt (at Bot2) - and is offered no third: the
# Ancestral Recall stays in exile with the lands. The Bolt it first chose and gave up at its target (CR 733.1) counts as
# none of the two.

